  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Meeting of ISP participants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide direct support to indigenous groups in Brazil 

To support networking between indigenous groups

To analyse the current situation relating to the indigenous movement in Brazil 

To support secular and religious indigenist organisations in Brazil and analyse their role within the indigenous movement

To define CAFOD&apos;s role in relation to its support for the indigenous movement in Brazil and in particular with:
small grassroots indigenous groups
indigenous organisations and networks
national indigenist groups (secular and religious) 
local church representatives/missionaries
international organisations working with indigenous issues

To define CAFOD&apos;s role in relation to national and international advocacy and lobbying on indigenous issues</narrative>
  </description>
